@startuml
actor 사용자
participant "runExecution" as execution
participant "docs/agents/execution.json" as manifest
participant "준비·설정·의존성 명령" as checks
participant "main argv" as main
participant "sessionOutput" as session
사용자 -> execution : workspace_root, profile_id, environment, signal
execution -> execution : workspace preflight
execution -> session : sessionOutputPath(runtime/execution/<profile_id>-<run-id>)
execution -> session : receipt 초기화(status=blocked, phase=load)
execution -> manifest : manifest 로드·JSON/schema/profile 검증
alt 환경값 또는 전체 argv 누락
  execution -> session : blocked receipt 기록
else 입력 검증 통과
  loop profile.prepare
    execution -> checks : prepare argv 실행
    checks --> execution : exit code
  end
  execution -> manifest : 준비 후 원문 변경 여부 확인
  execution -> execution : manifest와 config_inputs hash 기록
  loop profile.verify_config
    execution -> checks : 설정 검증 argv 실행
    checks --> execution : exit code
  end
  loop 각 dependency
    loop readiness_timeout_ms 이내 bounded poll
      execution -> checks : dependency.check argv 실행
      checks --> execution : exit code
    end
  end
  execution -> execution : 설정 hash 재확인
  alt 준비·검증·readiness·hash 실패
    execution -> session : blocked receipt 기록
  else 사전 점검 통과
    execution -> main : 정확한 command argv 실행
    main --> execution : exit code 또는 signal
    alt signal 취소
      execution -> session : interrupted receipt 기록
    else exit code = 0
      execution -> session : passed receipt 기록
    else exit code != 0 또는 timeout
      execution -> session : failed receipt 기록
    end
  end
end
note over checks,session
각 단계 로그와 receipt는 해당 실행의 session_directory 아래에 보존
준비 실패는 blocked, main 실행 실패는 failed로 분류
end note
@enduml
